# Step 9 with its instruments (P6.10; a ladder step at the switch): nothing in the step can be
# actuated, so the two supplies and the two draws are measured at their terminals.

fluidscript 1
circuit storageHeader
fluid dynamic water
show temperature

S1 inlet t=60 flow=0.12
S2 inlet t=45 flow=0.08
T1 tank volume=300 layers=5 layer[1].t=25 layer[2].t=30 layer[3].t=40 layer[4].t=50 layer[5].t=60 in.level=90% in[2].level=30% out.level=90% out[2].level=30%
RAD_NETWORK outlet flow=0.12
AHU_NETWORK outlet flow=0.08
TE_S1 t_sensor at S1
TE_S2 t_sensor at S2
TE_RAD t_sensor at RAD_NETWORK
TE_AHU t_sensor at AHU_NETWORK

connections
S1 - T1.in
S2 - T1.in[2]
T1.out - RAD_NETWORK
T1.out[2] - AHU_NETWORK
